sequenceDiagram
    %% sequence extras: actor creation with aliases, grouping, background rects
    participant Alice
    actor Bob
    Alice ->> Bob: solid arrow
    Alice -->> Bob: dotted arrow
    Alice -> Bob: solid line, no head
    Alice --> Bob: dotted line, no head
    Alice -x Bob: solid cross
    Alice --x Bob: dotted cross
    Alice -) Bob: solid open arrow
    Alice --) Bob: dotted open arrow
    Alice <<->> Bob: bidirectional solid
    Alice <<-->> Bob: bidirectional dotted
    rect rgba(0, 0, 255, .1)
        Alice ->> Bob: in a rect
    end
    Note left of Alice: left note
    Note over Alice: single-actor note
    loop retry
        Alice ->> Bob: again
    end
